              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ūyo alī Nji go ng'wa Yese akwīmīīla kūbiza lūbembeela kū banhū, hū Ng'wene ūyo mahanga gakūnkooba; hama ū wikalo wakwe būkūbiza n'ikūjo itaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, ū Seeba akūgūgoloola hangī ū nkono gwakwe lūkangala lwa kabīlī, kūbūkomoola nū būshiigo wa banhū bakwe abo bakūsangwa bataalī Ashulu, Misili, Esiopia, Elamu, Babuloni, Hamasi, na kū majinga ga mu nyanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
